;
UPLOAD - SEND FILES TO THE SYSOP

CALLER. Subject to current caller access policy.

A - Send files to the sysop

:A
SEND FILES TO THE SYSOP

    UPLOAD filename
    UPLOAD /Y

For a single file, supply its intended CP/M filename and select
XMODEM/CRC send in your terminal. For a batch, use /Y and select
YMODEM send. Follow the prompts and wait for confirmation.

    UPLOAD MYPROG.LBR

Completed submissions go to the sysop's private host inbox, not the
public library or WORK. XMODEM may leave record padding; YMODEM carries
the declared file length. Interrupted partial uploads are discarded,
but already completed batch members survive.

If the transfer stalls, check the protocol and send direction. Use
the terminal's transfer-cancel facility if necessary.

Leave a MESSAGE describing the submission, its author, hardware
requirements and any distribution restrictions.

See HELP TRANSFER and HELP MESSAGE.
